{"version":1,"content":"<p>有台灣「最帥大使」之稱的台灣駐馬紹爾群島大使徐蔚民，據報在上任不到一年後請辭。</p><p>他為雙十酒會構思的表演安排引發爭議，包括由當地民眾扛牀轎登場，以及擬演出的變裝皇后秀。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:05.856398+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723777+00:00","content_hash":"30adb03ca8494431d80b96bcb2daeea051ec008b683ab596473043d60b56602a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}